sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Staff (tablet)
  participant L as On-device SQLite
  participant Q as Upload queue
  participant P as Sync service
  participant A as API (rules engine)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  S->>L: Record temp 9°C (UUIDv7, client time)
  L-->>S: Instant red "fail" + corrective action prompt
  L->>Q: Queue write (offline)
  Note over S,Q: Wi-Fi drops in the cellar — app keeps working
  Q->>A: Connection back → upload queued writes in order
  A->>A: Re-evaluate vs site rules pack, check clock skew
  A->>D: Insert response (server_received_at, threshold snapshot)
  D-->>P: Change stream
  P-->>L: Sync down authoritative row + new work order
  L-->>S: "All synced" badge
  Q->>A: Photo uploaded in background
